input.prompt:
Review scope: ${/params/scope}

DIFF START (changed lines have exact labels [side path:line])
${/params/diff}
DIFF END

Copy the side, path and line from the exact label. Do not recount lines or include the label or the +/- marker in the quote. Return one raw JSON object: summary is a short string, limits is a short string, and findings is an array. Each finding has priority, path, side, line, quote, problem, recommendation. Keep problem and recommendation to a sentence each. Distinguish bounds-checked indexing that can panic from unchecked access. The first character must be { and the last must be }. No Markdown fences, no prose before or after. If there are no supported findings, return findings as [].
